# Cursor Rules for Brainaural Tones Project

## Test Files
- When running Playwright tests, always use CI-compatible commands:
  - Use `npx playwright test --reporter=line` for concise output
  - Use `npx playwright test --reporter=line --max-failures=0` to see all failures
  - Never use interactive reporters like `--reporter=html` in CI environments
  - Tests should complete without requiring manual intervention
  - Use `--timeout` flags if needed for slower environments
  - Prefer `--reporter=json` for programmatic processing of results

## General Development
- Use absolute paths when possible for tool calls
- Run commands in the application container using `dox-do` prefix when applicable
- Prefer editing existing files over creating new ones
- Always check for linting errors after making changes
